o chickpeas  and savory tahini so besides protein it  also adds good fats and filling fiber  next stock open essentials to stay  healthy while heading back to school  prebiotics are a type of fiber found in  foods like bananas asparagus onions and  oats that can support digestive and  immune health by helping to nourish the  good bacteria in the gut life's first  naturals cal colostrum also contains  prebiotics as well as immune factors and  protective proteins that provide immune  and digestive health benefits to adults  and children over the age of one poppy  is a better for you prebiotic soda made  with real clean ingredients and around  one tablespoon of pure unfiltered apple  cider vinegar unlike traditional soda  it's low in calories and sugar with 20  calories or less and 5 grams of sugar or  less per can and comes in delicious  flavors like raspberry rose grapefruit  and ginger lime next incorporate  probiotics which are beneficial bacteria  that help support digestive and immune  health they're found in fermented foods  like sauerkraut and yogurt as well as  high quality probiotic supplements like  truebiotics which is comprised of a  proprietary blend of the two most  clinically studied types of good  bacteria finally i have an after-school  snack that will help you stay cool these  homemade frozen smoothie tubes are a  cool treat with benefits simply blend up  your favorite smoothie add them to  resealable pouches and freeze until set  i hope you enjoyed these tips and  recipes you can find them at my website  nutritionbymia.com  and nutritionbymia on instagram where i  also share meal ideas and nutrition tips  daily
 

